      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This was likely because of the changes to GetRotation which were changed after the latest update for this world. This is an intentional change that breaks older worlds sadly.\n\nThe world must be updated to use GetTrackingData AvatarRoot rotation or GetTrackingData Origin.\n\nCheck Kung's comment here: https://feedback.vrchat.com/vrchat-ik-20/p/1333-unexpected-behavior-of-playerapigetrotation",
